Third-party colour palettes in @tyto/theme-pack
================================================

Each theme in src/themes/ maps an upstream palette onto Tyto's 40 theme tokens (ADR 0077).
The colours are the upstream's; the mapping onto Tyto's roles is this package's. A colour
changed to meet a contrast floor (ADR 0089) is listed in the adjusted version's "adjusted"
field with the value it replaced; such a theme also ships as the original, upstream exactly.
The status bar's vim mode badge (status-bar-vim-*) is Tyto's, derived from a role in each
palette; a badge colour moved off its role to read 4.5:1, or taken from another colour of
the same palette so that no two modes share one, is listed in "derived". Solarized's badge
for visual is upstream's magenta, #d33682, which no token carries.
Names are the upstream's; no logo or other branding is shipped.

Values read on 2026-10-15 from the sources below.


Dracula (src/themes/dracula.json, dracula-adjusted.json)
--------------------------------------------------------

Source:   https://github.com/dracula/visual-studio-code/blob/main/src/dracula.yml
Version:  2.25.1 (package.json on main), commit a08a206f2c8420ba3c05f0e8d01d43b2f933fdf8
Licence:  MIT

Mapping:  surface = BG, surface-raised = BGLight, surface-sunken = BGDark, hairline =
          BGDarker (tab.border), border and selection = SELECTION, text = FG, text-disabled
          and focus-ring = COMMENT (focusBorder), accent = PINK (tab.activeBorderTop,
          panelTitle.activeBorder), error = RED, warning = ORANGE (list.warningForeground),
          info = CYAN, success = GREEN, hover = LineHighlight (#44475A75) composited over
          BGLight, active-line = LineHighlight at 46 %, active-line-gutter = it composited
          over BG. Syntax from tokenColors: keyword and tag PINK, function and attribute
          GREEN, constant PURPLE, string YELLOW, punctuation FG, comment COMMENT. Upstream
          has no scrim or shadow colour; those are Tyto Dark's.
Adjusted: ships twice (ADR 0089 decision 7): Dracula, upstream exactly, and
          Dracula (adjusted), which changes, in src/themes/dracula-adjusted.json:
            text-muted      #6272a4 -> #9fa9c7

