One Dark (src/themes/one-dark.json, one-dark-adjusted.json)
-----------------------------------------------------------

Files:     src/themes/one-dark.json, src/themes/one-dark-adjusted.json
Source:    https://github.com/atom/atom/tree/master/packages/one-dark-syntax
          (styles/colors.less, styles/syntax-variables.less) and
          https://github.com/atom/atom/tree/master/packages/one-dark-ui
          (styles/ui-variables-custom.less, styles/ui-variables.less)
Version:   one-dark-syntax 1.8.4 and one-dark-ui 1.12.5 (package.json), commit
          1c3bd35ce238dc0491def9e1780d04748d8e18af
Licence:  MIT

Mapping:   Less's hsl(), darken() and lighten() worked out to hex. surface = @syntax-bg,
          surface-raised = @level-3-color (tabs and tool panels), surface-sunken =
          @input-background-color, border and hairline = @base-border-color, text = @mono-1,
          text-muted = @mono-2, text-disabled and syntax-comment = @mono-3, accent and
          focus-ring = @syntax-accent, accent-text = the dark side of @accent-text-color's
          contrast(), selection = @syntax-selection-color, hover =
          @background-color-highlight, error, warning, info and success =
          @text-color-error/-warning/-info/-success, scrim = @overlay-backdrop-color at
          @overlay-backdrop-opacity, active-line = @syntax-cursor-line, active-line-gutter =
          it composited over surface. Syntax: keyword @hue-3, function @hue-2, constant and
          attribute @hue-6, string @hue-4, tag @hue-5, punctuation @mono-1. Upstream has no
          shadow colour; those are Tyto Dark's.
Adjusted: ships twice (ADR 0089 decision 7): One Dark, upstream exactly, and
          One Dark (adjusted), which changes, in src/themes/one-dark-adjusted.json:
            text-muted      #828997 -> #989ea9
            syntax-comment  #5c6370 -> #6c7584

